-   @date       Wed Sep 20 09:05:59 2000
-   @author     Tom Goodale
-   @desc 
-   Compare the precedence of two operators.
-   @enddesc 
-   @calls     
-   @calledby   
-   @history 
- 
-   @endhistory 
-   @var     op1
-   @vdesc   First operator
-   @vtype   const char *
